\n The <table:table-cell> element 325935 The <table:table-cell> element represents a table cell. It is contained in a table row element. A table cell can contain paragraphs and other text content as well as nested tables. Table cells may span multiple columns and rows. Table cells may be empty.

The <table:table-cell> element is usable within the following element: <table:table-row> 9.1.3.

